### AI Provider Support

| Provider | Models | Embedding Dimensions | Authentication |
|----------|--------|---------------------|----------------|
| **OpenAI** | GPT-4o, GPT-4o-mini | 1536 (text-embedding-ada-002) | API Key |
| **Azure OpenAI** | GPT-4o, GPT-4o-mini, o4-mini | 1536 (text-embedding-ada-002) | API Key or Entra ID |
| **Local (HuggingFace)** | Flan-T5-large, sentence-transformers | 384-768 (configurable) | None |
| **Local (Llama.cpp)** | GGML models (Llama, Mistral, etc.) | N/A (uses HF embeddings) | None |

### Database Schema

```mermaid
erDiagram
    DOCUMENT_VECTORS {
        uuid id PK
        text content
        jsonb metadata
        vector_1536 embedding
        timestamp created_at
    }
    
    APP_CONFIG {
        varchar key PK
        varchar value
        timestamp updated_at
    }
    
    INGESTION_LOG {
        uuid id PK
        varchar pdf_path
        int chunk_count
        varchar status
        timestamp ingested_at
    }

    DOCUMENT_VECTORS ||--o{ APP_CONFIG : "configured_by"
```

