## Data Flow

### PDF Ingestion Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as React Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI Backend
    participant Auth as Entra ID Auth
    participant Ingestion as ingestion.py
    participant Provider as AI Provider
    participant DB as PostgreSQL+pgvector

    User->>UI: Upload PDF file
    UI->>Auth: Verify JWT token
    Auth-->>UI: Token valid
    UI->>API: POST /ingest<br/>(multipart/form-data)
    API->>Auth: Validate token & roles
    Auth-->>API: Authorized
    API->>Ingestion: ingest_pdf(file_path)
    
    Ingestion->>Ingestion: Load PDF with PyPDFLoader
    Ingestion->>Ingestion: Split text into chunks<br/>(1000 chars, 200 overlap)
    
    loop For each chunk
        Ingestion->>Provider: Generate embedding
        Provider-->>Ingestion: Vector (1536 dims)
    end
    
    Ingestion->>DB: INSERT INTO document_vectors
    DB-->>Ingestion: Success
    
    Ingestion->>DB: UPDATE app_config
    Ingestion-->>API: {"status": "success", "chunks": N}
    API-->>UI: 200 OK + metadata
    UI-->>User: "PDF ingested successfully"
```

### Question Answering Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as React Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI Backend
    participant Auth as Entra ID Auth
    participant Ingestion as ingestion.py
    participant Provider as AI Provider
    participant DB as PostgreSQL+pgvector

    User->>UI: Enter question
    UI->>Auth: Verify JWT token
    Auth-->>UI: Token valid
    UI->>API: POST /chat<br/>{"question": "..."}
    API->>Auth: Validate token & roles
    Auth-->>API: Authorized
    
    API->>Ingestion: load_retriever()
    Ingestion->>Provider: Embed question
    Provider-->>Ingestion: Query vector
    
    Ingestion->>DB: Vector similarity search<br/>(ORDER BY embedding <=> query_vec)<br/>LIMIT 4
    DB-->>Ingestion: Top 4 matching chunks
    
    API->>API: Deduplicate sources<br/>by content hash
    API->>Ingestion: chat_with_retriever(question)
    
    Ingestion->>Ingestion: Build prompt with context
    Ingestion->>Provider: LLM API call<br/>(system + context + question)
    Provider-->>Ingestion: Generated answer
    
    Ingestion-->>API: {"answer": "..."}
    API->>API: Attach source metadata
    API-->>UI: {"answer": "...", "sources": [...]}
    UI-->>User: Display answer + sources
```

### Configuration Update Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant UI as ConfigCard Component
    participant API as FastAPI Backend
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Cache as In-Memory Config

    Admin->>UI: Select new provider<br/>(e.g., AZURE_OPENAI)
    UI->>API: POST /config/update<br/>{"key": "LLM_PROVIDER", "value": "AZURE_OPENAI"}
    
    API->>API: Validate value<br/>(must be OPENAI, AZURE_OPENAI, LOCAL)
    alt Invalid value
        API-->>UI: 400 Bad Request
        UI-->>Admin: Error message
    else Valid value
        API->>DB: UPDATE app_config<br/>SET value = 'AZURE_OPENAI'
        DB-->>API: Success
        API->>Cache: Reload configuration
        API-->>UI: 200 OK
        UI-->>Admin: "Config updated successfully"
    end
```

