### Alert Rules

| Alert | Condition | Severity | Action |
|-------|-----------|----------|--------|
| High Error Rate | Error rate > 5% for 5 min | High | Send notification, page on-call |
| API Quota Exhausted | 429 responses from AI provider | Medium | Send notification, switch provider |
| High Latency | p95 latency > 10s for 10 min | Medium | Send notification, investigate |
| Database Connection Failure | Cannot connect to PostgreSQL | Critical | Page on-call, attempt reconnect |
| Disk Space Low | Disk usage > 90% | High | Send notification, clean old logs |
| Memory High | Memory usage > 85% for 10 min | Medium | Send notification, investigate leak |

