## Appendix

### Glossary

- **RAG**: Retrieval-Augmented Generation - AI technique combining retrieval and generation
- **Vector Embedding**: Numerical representation of text in high-dimensional space
- **Similarity Search**: Finding vectors closest to a query vector
- **Chunk**: Segment of text from a document
- **LLM**: Large Language Model (e.g., GPT-4o)
- **Entra ID**: Microsoft Entra ID (formerly Azure Active Directory)
- **JWT**: JSON Web Token - standard for secure authentication
- **RBAC**: Role-Based Access Control
- **pgvector**: PostgreSQL extension for vector similarity search

